{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fanta Hitchhikers is a casual roguelike shooter where the Fairy Godmother drives a magical carriage through the roads of another world, facing endless waves of slimes. Dash across the battlefield, pick up new heroes, and build unique combinations with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat is fast-paced and easy to control, but every decision you make adds depth and challenge to each round. Enjoy satisfying quick sessions or refine your build through countless attempts for the perfect run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo version includes the first three stages of the full game.</strong><br>You can experience all of the core combat, controls, and hero systems exactly as in the full release, but later stages (4\u20135) are not included in this build.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126910?t=1762916856","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126910?t=1762916856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126910/6d845c9aa17bad4785a1fc67868cd8e988df0712/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762916856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126910/6d845c9aa17bad4785a1fc67868cd8e988df0712/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762916856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fanta Hitchhikers is a casual roguelike shooter where the Fairy Godmother drives a magical carriage through the roads of another world, facing endless waves of slimes. Dash across the battlefield, pick up new heroes, and build unique combinations with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat is fast-paced and easy to control, but every decision you make adds depth and challenge to each round. Enjoy satisfying quic